==Restrictions==
Max # of Deployable Cats: 2

==Battleground==
*1 [[Chocolate Doge]] spawns after 14.67 seconds<sup>440f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 56.67 seconds<sup>1,700f</sup>.
*1 [[Chickful A]] spawns after 113.33 seconds<sup>3,400f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Mind the cat limit and bring Attack/Defense UP [[Cat Combo]]s! Send out [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] and let him eviscerate the first Chickful A, then [[Crazed Cow Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Manic Lion Cat]] to tank a hit or two from her when she staggers. Once Chickful A is dead, Bahamut should then move on to Chocolate Doge; at that point, start sending out [[Talents|Talented]] [[Cats in a Box (Special Cat)|Heavy Assault C.A.T.s]] or [[Weightlifter Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Pizza Cats]] to expedite the killing process. The sooner you can get him off the field, the better. Afterwards, the cleanup phase should be a breeze with [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Ramen Cat]] and any powerful ranged attacker of your choice.

